    "answer": "i and iii",
    "explanation": "<p>$3 x^2+4 y^2=1$</p><p>বা, $\\frac{\\mathrm{x}^2}{\\frac{1}{3}}+\\frac{\\mathrm{y}^2}{\\frac{1}{4}}=1 \\therefore \\frac{\\mathrm{x}^2}{\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\right)^2}+\\frac{\\mathrm{y}^2}{\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2}=1 \\therefore \\mathrm{e}=\\sqrt{1-\\frac{\\frac{1}{4}}{\\frac{1}{3}}}=\\frac{1}{2}$</p><p>$\\therefore $ উপকেন্দ্র,$( \\pm \\mathrm{ae}, 0) \\equiv\\left( \\pm \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\times \\frac{1}{2}, 0\\right) \\equiv\\left( \\pm \\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{3}}, 0\\right)$</p><p>$\\therefore$ (ii) নং তথ্যটি সঠিক নয়।</p>"
